new_dynarec arm64: assemble linkage_arm64.S for Mach-O

The core's Makefile sets NO_ASM on Apple Silicon ("assembly compilation not yet
supported"), which leaves macOS arm64 without a recompiler. The file only needs the
Mach-O spellings: a leading underscore on C symbols, .private_extern instead of
.hidden/.type, and @PAGE/@PAGEOFF instead of :lo12:. ELF output is unchanged.

